{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56805","headline":"眇目道士命牋毫书诗（题拟） · 不详","name":"眇目道士命牋毫书诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹊羽桥成星斗连，何须携室下遥天。\n来逢蓬荜当诸夜，共缀词华染素牋。\n霓帔岂劳施粉藻，宝冠犹更贴花钿。\n人间限满离尘土，即俟瑶阶厕列仙。\n（《灯下闲谈》卷上《桃花障子》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}